{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00459",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 4.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. Where would you like me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.3,
      "end_seconds": 8.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.34,
      "end_seconds": 17.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a very painful, swollen big toe. It's getting on my nerves now. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.52,
      "end_seconds": 19.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Anything that helps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.81,
      "end_seconds": 22.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Ice helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.83,
      "end_seconds": 25.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.91,
      "end_seconds": 28.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.06,
      "end_seconds": 31.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "What makes it worse, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.67,
      "end_seconds": 36.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "The bedsheet touching it definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.36,
      "end_seconds": 40.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.47,
      "end_seconds": 54.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.8,
      "text": "It's a few times a day. Well, as for redness over the joint, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.11,
      "end_seconds": 57.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Has there been trouble walking too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.63,
      "end_seconds": 62.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Yes, uh, about the same, about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.58,
      "end_seconds": 67.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.59,
      "end_seconds": 69.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.85,
      "end_seconds": 79.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any trauma to the toe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.68,
      "end_seconds": 85.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Well, um, not at all, no trauma to the toe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.13,
      "end_seconds": 91.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chills, recent illness, rash or kidney problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.28,
      "end_seconds": 97.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "No chills, recent illness, rash or kidney problems, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.97,
      "end_seconds": 102.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.36,
      "end_seconds": 104.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.1,
      "end_seconds": 109.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.5,
      "end_seconds": 120.82,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.42,
      "end_seconds": 123.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.54,
      "end_seconds": 125.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.78,
      "end_seconds": 128.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.82,
      "end_seconds": 132.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.34,
      "end_seconds": 137.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Right, how's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.45,
      "end_seconds": 143.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.19,
      "end_seconds": 148.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.65,
      "end_seconds": 156.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about ten years. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.2,
      "end_seconds": 165.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.94,
      "end_seconds": 169.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.52,
      "end_seconds": 173.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Hold on, the screen's frozen for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.17,
      "end_seconds": 191.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Good, where were we. Right, I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.7,
      "end_seconds": 205.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.74,
      "end_seconds": 225.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.25,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, heart rate 78, weight 71 kilos, BMI works out to 30.3, temp 36.5 degrees, blood pressure 119 over 74, height 153 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.55,
      "end_seconds": 229.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.34,
      "end_seconds": 232.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.33,
      "end_seconds": 235.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.93,
      "end_seconds": 255.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "The big toe joint is red, hot, swollen and extremely tender to touch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.03,
      "end_seconds": 283.44,
      "duration_seconds": 22.41,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Putting it all together, it fits best with an acute gout flare. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out septic arthritis yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.82,
      "end_seconds": 291.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a very painful, swollen big toe, moderate, and no kidney problems or rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.94,
      "end_seconds": 296.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.37,
      "end_seconds": 303.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.35,
      "end_seconds": 314.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.65,
      "end_seconds": 339.84,
      "duration_seconds": 24.19,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange kidney function tests for gout. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'll start you on colchicine, 0.5 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. That should help with gout flare. Cut right back on red meat, organ meats, beer and sugary drinks, and drink plenty of water. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.44,
      "end_seconds": 357.8,
      "duration_seconds": 17.36,
      "text": "Mm. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. If the joint gets hotter or you develop a fever, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.48,
      "end_seconds": 360.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Well, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.04,
      "end_seconds": 370.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.07,
      "end_seconds": 383.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "So, uh, I take the colchicine, 0.5 milligrams, twice a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.74,
      "end_seconds": 388.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. All right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.64,
      "end_seconds": 393.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}